# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0019245> (lysosomal lipid storage disorder)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21502308") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Wikipedia:Lipid_storage_disorder") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0019245> "An inherited metabolic disorder in which harmful amounts of lipids accumulate in cells and tissues. Because of a functionally impaired hydrolase or auxiliary protein, their lipid substrates cannot be degraded, accumulate in the lysosome, and slowly spread to other intracellular membranes.")
